148: /* A reset, so it must carry a reset's specificity. Written plainly as
149:    `.classroom-root button` it scores (0,1,1) and outranks every Tailwind text
150:    utility (0,1,0), which silently swallowed the colour of any button that set
151:    its own: `text-white` on the hero's PrepTest trigger rendered near-black on
152:    the near-black console (~1:1 contrast), and `text-primary-foreground` on the
153:    launchers' filled CTAs rendered white on white. `:where()` contributes zero
154:    specificity, dropping this to (0,0,1): bare buttons still inherit, and any
155:    button that states a colour now keeps it. */
156: :where(.classroom-root) button {
157:   color: inherit;
158: }
