2638:    56ch, not the 68ch you would reach for. The `ch` unit is the width of "0",
2639:    and in Outfit that is 9.71px against a 7.58px average character, so 68ch
2640:    renders about 87 characters a line. 56ch measures ~72, which is inside the
2641:    65-75 the rule actually asks for. Measured in the browser, not assumed. */
